   2:Source/ui/settings_page.c **** //
   3:Source/ui/settings_page.c **** // Six rows: Search Engine (cycle NAMES), Browse Mode (toggle), Invert
   4:Source/ui/settings_page.c **** // Crank (toggle), Image Mode (cycle NAMES order), Clear Cookies (action,
   5:Source/ui/settings_page.c **** // runs immediately), Protocol (cycle HTTP/TCP). Save writes staged ->
   6:Source/ui/settings_page.c **** // Storage.settings + save() + onChange; Cancel discards. Box animates from
   7:Source/ui/settings_page.c **** // center, ease-out-cubic.
